              "value": 13
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "It is paramount that you are understood and you understand others; language need not impede your message. You can cast tongues as a 5th-level divine innate spell once per day on yourself only. You gain a +1 status bonus to Diplomacy checks for the duration of the spell when speaking to creatures with whom you already shared a language before casting."
            }
          }
        }
